    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.epaggellomenos.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.epaggellomenos.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_epaggellomenos">
        <head>ΕΠΑΓΓΕΛΛΟΜΕΝΟΣ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-1">
          <head>I.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-1-l1">Τὸ σὸν ταπεινὸν ἂν σὺ σεμνύνῃς, καλὸν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-1-l2">ἔξω φανεῖται, φίλ᾽ ἄνερ· ἂν δ᾽ αὐτὸς ποιῇς</l>
              <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-1-l3">ταπεινὸν αὐτὸ καὶ τιθῇς ἐν μηδενί,</l>
              <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-1-l4">οἰκεῖος οὗτος κατάγελως νομίζεται.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. XXII 29.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Versu primo σεμνύνῃς vir doctus in Ephemer. Ien. 1828 no. 148. Libri σεμνύνῃ.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2-l1">Τὰ γὰρ τολμηρὰ τῶν ὄχλων ἔχει</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2-l2">ἐν τοῖς λογισμοῖς τὰς ἐπιδείξεις δυσκόλους,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2-l3">ἐν τῷ δὲ πράττειν, ἂν λάβῃ τὸν καιρὸν εὖ,</l>
              <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2-l4">ἀπροσδόκητον τὴν τέχνην ἐξηύρατο.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. LI 27.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vs. 2 τὰς Gaisfordus. Vulgo μέν. A et Trinc. μὲν τάς. — Vs. 3 ἐξηύρατο A. Vulgo ἐξεύρατο. Fortasse ἐξηύρετο. V. Lobeckius ad Phryn. p. 139.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2_2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2_2-l1">Nempe vulgi temeritas</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2_2-l2">in moliendo turbidas curas habet:</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2_2-l3">at inter actus, si bona est occasio,</l>
            <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-2_2-l4">rectam rationem inexspectatam invenerit.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-3">
          <head>III.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-3-l1">Τοῖς ἀναιδέσιν βοηθεῖ γὰρ λόγοις τοῦθ᾽ ἓν μόνον,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-3-l2">ἂν βραχεῖς αὐτοὺς ποιῇ τις τόν τε καιρὸν εὖ λάβῃ.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <pb n="116" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044098646714:scan:140" />
          <note type="apparatus">
            <bibl>Stobaeus Flor. XXXV 5</bibl>. Vulgo ἀναιδεέσι. A et B ἀναιδέσι. Vs. 2 Trinc. ποῇ.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-3_2">
          <head>III.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-3_2-l1">Unum est quo valere possit impudens oratio,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-3_2-l2">si brevis sit, atque articulum recte capiet temporis.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-epaggellomenos-4">
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Suidas</bibl>, Εἰς τὸ δέον. — καὶ Μένανδρος ἐν Ἀπαγγελλομένῳ, μέμνηται δὲ καὶ ἑτέρωθι.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Corr. Ἐπαγγελλομένῳ.</note>
        </div>
      </div>
